networkmanager-headers provides pkg-config modules:

  # libnm-core headers of the NetworkManager client library (headers only)
  libnm

Only the headers are installed, without the library: the constants and types
of the NetworkManager D-Bus API can be used, but not the libnm functions.
In CMake, use the module for compiling only, never for linking:

  find_package(PkgConfig REQUIRED)
  pkg_check_modules(LIBNM REQUIRED IMPORTED_TARGET libnm)
  target_link_libraries(main PRIVATE $<COMPILE_ONLY:PkgConfig::LIBNM>)

Installed CMake package configuration files MUST NOT find_dependency() it.
